 Sessions  C-a f  pick or open (tm)     C-a b  back to last     C-a s  tree
           C-a (  C-a )  prev / next    C-a $  rename           C-a d  detach
           C-a f then Ctrl-F  search every folder under ~, not just recent ones
 SSH       tm sessions hide this tmux; use C-b for it there (C-b f, C-b b)
           F12  hand all keys to a nested tmux, F12 again to take them back
 Windows   C-a c  new                   C-a n  C-a p  next / prev    C-a ,  rename
{{- if eq .profile "minimal" }}
 Panes     C-a %  C-a "  split          C-a arrows  move        C-a z  zoom
{{- else }}
 Panes     C-a |  C-a -  split          C-a h/j/k/l  move       C-a z  zoom
           C-a H/J/K/L  resize          C-a x  close            C-a <  C-a >  swap windows
{{- end }}
 Nvim      C-h/j/k/l  move between panes and Neovim splits   C-a C-l  clear screen
 Copy      C-a [  then v to select, {{ if eq .profile "minimal" }}Enter{{ else }}y{{ end }} to copy, q to quit
